          "observation": "notice.queueCountBefore"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.surfaceAvailableAfterFaultRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.queuePendingAfterFaultRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": 0,
          "observation": "notice.queueCountAfterFaultRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "notice.surfaceAvailableAfterRestore"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.stateReadBudgetConsumed"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.budgetConsumedWithoutDisplay"
        },
        {
          "equals": 0,
          "observation": "notice.totalDisplayedCount"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.staleNoticeAfterRecovery"
        }
      ],
      "id": "recovery-before-display-cancels-queue",
      "phaseNote": "明确限定为消息组件真正不可用（不含仅界面被占用）。步骤包含故障恢复后恢复消息组件的独立动作。",
      "prerequisites": [
        "原生消息组件不可用，使故障消息只能排队。",
        "在消息实际显示前可使故障恢复。"
      ],
      "profileId": "local-fault-notices",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-14"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "在消息组件不可用时注入状态读取故障。预期：排队且尚未显示。检查：notice.surfaceAvailableBefore=false 且 notice.queuePendingBefore=true。",
        "在消息实际显示前使故障恢复。预期：清除排队消息且不消耗机会。检查：notice.queuePendingAfterFaultRecovery=false 且 notice.queueCountAfterFaultRecovery=0。",
        "在故障恢复后恢复原生消息组件。预期：不显示过期消息且机会仍未消耗。检查：notice.surfaceAvailableAfterRestore=true 且 notice.stateReadBudgetConsumed=false。"
      ],
      "title": "消息组件不可用时排队、故障先恢复、随后恢复组件也不补发且不消耗机会"
    },
    {
      "category": "queue",
      "evidence": {
        "log": true,
        "measurement": true,
        "screenshot": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.surfaceAvailableBefore"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "notice.queuePendingBefore"
        },
        {
          "equals": 0,
          "observation": "notice.stateReadDisplayedCountBefore"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.stateReadBudgetConsumedBefore"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.queuePendingAfterCancellation"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.stateReadBudgetConsumedAfterCancellation"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "notice.surfaceAvailableBeforeRefault"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "ui.safetyGateClearBeforeRefault"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.staleNoticeAfterRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": 1,
          "observation": "notice.stateReadDisplayedCountAfterRefault"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "notice.stateReadBudgetConsumed"
        }
      ],
      "id": "cancelled-queue-preserves-budget-for-refailure",
      "phaseNote": "使用阶段专用键表达初始排队、取消后、恢复原生消息组件后与再次失效四个阶段：先取消排队，再恢复原生消息组件，方可在同次载入内再次失效并实际显示一次，不以终态计数代替阶段。",
      "prerequisites": [
        "已成功载入的合法存档：两个解锁门槛均满足，且注入前已成功观察到一次就绪读取；受影响类别的提示机会尚未消耗。",
        "初始状态读取故障因原生消息组件不可用而被排队且尚未显示。",
        "同次载入内可使该故障恢复并在不重载的情况下恢复原生消息组件。"
      ],
      "profileId": "local-fault-notices",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-14"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "记录初始排队状态与显示次数。预期：故障消息因原生消息组件不可用而排队且尚未显示，提示机会未消耗。检查：notice.surfaceAvailableBefore=false 且 notice.queuePendingBefore=true 且 notice.stateReadDisplayedCountBefore=0 且 notice.stateReadBudgetConsumedBefore=false。",
        "在消息显示前使故障恢复。预期：取消排队且提示机会仍未消耗。检查：notice.queuePendingAfterCancellation=false 且 notice.stateReadBudgetConsumedAfterCancellation=false。",
        "恢复原生消息组件。预期：消息组件可用且原生 UI 安全门已清空。检查：notice.surfaceAvailableBeforeRefault=true 且 ui.safetyGateClearBeforeRefault=true。",
        "在同次载入内再次注入同类故障。预期：实际显示一次并消耗机会，且不补发已取消的消息。检查：notice.stateReadDisplayedCountAfterRefault=1 且 notice.stateReadBudgetConsumed=true 且 notice.staleNoticeAfterRecovery=false。"
      ],
      "title": "取消排队后同次载入再次失效仍可显示一次并消耗机会"
    },
    {
