        },
        {
          "equals": 0,
          "observation": "notice.totalDisplayedCount"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "notice.staleNoticeAfterRecovery"
        }
      ],
      "id": "exit-drops-queued-notice",
      "prerequisites": [
        "存在尚未显示的旧存档待显示故障消息。",
        "退出属于普通卸载而非异常状态丢失。"
      ],
      "profileId": "local-fault-notices",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-14"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "在消息显示前退出存档返回主菜单。预期：识别为普通退出。检查：load.transition=exit-to-menu 且 state.ordinaryLoadingOrExit=true。",
        "记录排队清除标志与显示次数。预期：丢弃排队且无过期消息。检查：notice.queueClearedOnLoadExit=true 且 notice.queueCountAfter=0。"
      ],
      "title": "退出存档丢弃旧存档待显示消息且不残留"
    }
  ],
